  return json({ error: 'Unauthorized' }, { status: 401 });
}
```

`validateDebugToken(null, undefined)` → `false` (no token, no expected token → 401)
`validateDebugToken('Bearer anything', undefined)` → `false` (has token, no expected token → 401)

